{"message":"Total leased facilities in the table are 8.1 million square feet and total facilities are 56.0 million square feet, so the leased share is (8.1 / 56.0) × 100 ≈ 14.46%.","final":{"answer":14.46,"unit":"percent","sources":["source:t2c3n0","source:t3c3n0"],"result_id":"public_document:d85cc8ebb1e42cde0d0180d3903614267456df19f80cbba19d14c31cdb96f1fc"}}